src/mineru_layout.h is a C++ translation/adaptation of the layout parser,
crop geometry, OTSL conversion, basic postprocessing and Markdown composition
in the following upstream Python files:
  mineru_vl_utils/mineru_client.py
  mineru_vl_utils/structs.py
  mineru_vl_utils/post_process/otsl2html.py
  mineru_vl_utils/post_process/json2markdown.py
  mineru_vl_utils/post_process/__init__.py

Changes: dependency-free header-only C++ data structures and implementation;
bounded scanning and numeric input validation; JSON serialization; basic-only
postprocessing explicitly separated from the full upstream document pipeline.
The original source functions are not claimed to be byte-identical in this
translation. Full formula/image/table-image postprocessing uses the original
pinned Python package through python/crispembed/_mineru.py, without loading a
Python model runtime. Its complete .py source tree is authenticated by SHA-256.

